@startuml
actor User
participant Controller
participant GoodsService
participant GoodsMapper

User -> Controller: 发起操作请求
activate Controller
Controller -> GoodsService: 调用operationGoods方法
activate GoodsService
GoodsService -> GoodsMapper: 根据操作类型执行数据库操作
activate GoodsMapper

alt 操作类型为更新
    GoodsMapper --> GoodsService: 执行更新操作
else 操作类型为删除
    GoodsMapper --> GoodsService: 执行删除操作
else 操作类型为添加
    GoodsMapper --> GoodsService: 执行插入操作
end

GoodsMapper --> GoodsService: 返回操作结果
deactivate GoodsMapper
GoodsService --> Controller: 返回操作结果
deactivate GoodsService
Controller --> User: 返回操作结果
deactivate Controller

@enduml
